{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02WI", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$F, G, H : (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}^{opp} \\to \\textit{Sets}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0005": "$a : F \\to G$", "MATH_0006": "$b : H \\to G$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nH \\times_{b, G, a} F \\ar[r]_-{b'} \\ar[d]_{a'} & F \\ar[d]^a \\\\\nH \\ar[r]^b & G\n}\n$$", "MATH_0008": "$a$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "MATH_0010": "$a'$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{P}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-relative-representable-property}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-representable-transformations-property}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:82ba8d9e90c5b3eb74035e00add934244826bb349d387f1595507ca30d4e4148", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:620c7beb19ac0ba8dc5f121e13f2bb91cd5c64268939760a4d302593079d6b45", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a property as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be a representable transformation of functors.\nLet <MATH_0006> be any transformation of functors.\nConsider the fibre product diagram\n<MATH_0007>\nIf <MATH_0008> has property <MATH_0009> then also the base change <MATH_0010>\nhas property <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eb9aed792d4b0279bfd8a95dfc42f70e23a042f78b1ad895aa01a11a692382c2", "unit_id": "tag:02WL:statement"}
